        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROADMAP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/37a72582d021db1a15da1346d93b045a.avif?t=1775814413\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve just arrived in town. The soft spring air lifts the cherry blossoms around you, and for the first time in a long while, you feel you’re fighting for something honorable. <br>As you step inside your temple, it’s time to train and prepare for what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samurai’s Path</strong> is an experimental game that evolves alongside its community. Your journey begins with the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train with Mini-Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/19627966805944dee7cc0230f5f44caa.poster.avif?t=1775814413\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/19627966805944dee7cc0230f5f44caa.webm?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/19627966805944dee7cc0230f5f44caa.mp4?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every few hours, you’ll receive new missions. Embark on small training challenges and earn a <strong>Katana Box</strong> for each successful completion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Katana Collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/448a146fad18294c949ef279fd2163d9.poster.avif?t=1775814413\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/448a146fad18294c949ef279fd2163d9.webm?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/448a146fad18294c949ef279fd2163d9.mp4?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Katanas inside boxes and expand your collection: from <strong>Common</strong> and <strong>Rare</strong> to <strong>Epic</strong> and <strong>Legendary</strong> blades. <br>All Katanas can be <strong>traded and collected</strong> through the <strong>Steam Market</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>First set of Seasonal Katanas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F</strong>our honoring <strong>Amaterasu</strong>, and four dedicated to <strong>Susanoo, </strong>will not be dropping after the season two releases. Only available as drop in Limited Boxes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amaterasu and Susanoo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ancient tales, <strong>Amaterasu</strong>, the radiant goddess of the sun, embodies honor, clarity, and creation, her light guiding every true samurai’s path. <strong>Susanoo</strong>, her tempestuous brother, commands storms and chaos, testing the strength of all who seek mastery. Their eternal balance between order and fury shapes the soul of every blade forged in <i>Samurai’s Path</i>, whether it shines with divine grace or strikes with untamed power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Katana Boxes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/33d0f51fa422f5a9415e832c88ed7615.poster.avif?t=1775814413\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/33d0f51fa422f5a9415e832c88ed7615.webm?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/33d0f51fa422f5a9415e832c88ed7615.mp4?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vanilla Box</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original boxes of <i>Samurai’s Path</i>. Contain Katanas following standard drop rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common Katana 70% <br>Rare Katana 27% <br>Epic Katana 3%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Box</strong> <br>Available only during the first weeks after launch. This limited-edition box offers a <strong>higher chance of Epic Katanas</strong> and a <strong>slight chance to obtain one of the eight Legendary. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common Katana 27% <br>Rare Katana 60% <br>Epic Katana 10% <br>Legendary Katana (Amaterasu or Susanoo collection) 3%</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge More Katanas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/e2985157517c41acc909f00aeafebd50.poster.avif?t=1775814413\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/e2985157517c41acc909f00aeafebd50.webm?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/e2985157517c41acc909f00aeafebd50.mp4?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine <strong>three Katanas</strong> to forge a new Katana Box. Using rarer Katanas increases your odds of receiving a <strong>Limited Box</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited Box:  <br>+5% for each common Katana used <br>+10% for each rare Katana used <br> <br>Vanilla Box: <br>The remaining percentage is related to this box. <br>Example: Forging by using tone common katana (+5%) and two rare katanas (+10% X2). Total rate: 75% Vanilla Box and 25% Limited Box</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Letter System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/420ab110999b7a31c533a28934168e63.poster.avif?t=1775814413\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/420ab110999b7a31c533a28934168e63.webm?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716880/extras/420ab110999b7a31c533a28934168e63.mp4?t=1775814413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From time to time, you’ll receive <strong>letters</strong> from your family or townsfolk. <br>These messages reveal hints of future content and allow you to <strong>accumulate wealth and resources</strong> for the next stage in the evolution of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Founder’s Quest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available <strong>only until the next major update</strong>, the Founder’s Quest rewards <strong>Seals</strong> for each completed mission. <br>Obtain the <strong>Expanded Book</strong> to unlock access to a <strong>unique Legendary Katana </strong>that hides true power (which will never drop again in the game) and gain exclusive perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s Next</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Samurai’s Path</i> will continue to evolve with the guidance of its community. <br>Here’s a glimpse of what’s coming in <strong>Season 2</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Legendary Katanas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>revamped Letter System</strong> featuring hidden easter eggs that unlock limited-edition Legendary blades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Merchant</strong>: Buy Katanas that refresh daily and sell your own for fluctuating coin values.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gambling House</strong>: Test your luck in games of cards, dice, and bluffing while waiting for your next mission.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These updates mark the <strong>next step in the evolution of Samurai’s Path</strong>, introducing <strong>character progression and customization</strong> that will shape your destiny as a true warrior.</p>",
